{
  "name": "stt-det (settings STT + transcriptions, operator + builder; seeded config + transcripts assert populated, mic + file-picker + delete drive to boundary only)",
  "stopOnError": false,
  "notes": [
    "The STT page saves through SettingsSubPage (route='stt', onSave): one shared footer (settings-subpage-footer / settings-subpage-save) and a toast (settings-save-toast-success). The page-local sticky bar and inline saved status are gone.",
    "stt-language-select is a native <select> over STT_LANGUAGES, driven with selectOption. It is set to 'it' before the first save because the save button only enables on a real change, and neither the seed ('en') nor settings-det.json ('de' discarded, 'es' saved) leaves that value, so the dirty state holds whether this script runs standalone or inside master-det.",
    "TranscriptCard no longer anchors the source label (it became the EntityCard title); the card metadata row is asserted on transcript-time + transcript-duration + transcript-text.",
    "Saving hot-reloads the engine: Stt.svelte's onSave sets sttApplied on a successful reloadStt() and only falls back to sttNeedsRestart when the reload throws. The seeded run reloads fine, so the deterministic assertion is stt-applied-notice, not the restart banner."
  ],
  "dynamicTestids": [
    "settings-nav-stt",
    "sidebar-mode-option-builder",
    "sidebar-mode-option-operator"
  ],
